@baseUrl = https://localhost:7289
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN

### MF-01: Platform Admin loads active milestones for the Commission Rule form.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commission-milestones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 and APPLICATION_CREATED, START_WORK, PROBATION_PASSED, WARRANTY_PASSED.

### MF-01: Verify inactive milestone filtering after an admin management API exists.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commission-milestones?isActive=false
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Expected errors: 403 for a non-admin JWT and 401 when no JWT is supplied.
